    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "问与答",
      "content": "A: What do you hear? B: I hear a cat. hear 是“听见”，注意和 see（看见）的区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "see 和 hear",
      "content": "see 用眼睛，hear 用耳朵。I see a bird.（我看见鸟）I hear a bird.（我听见鸟叫）"
    }
  ],
  "exercises": [
